Package: macubuntu
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: git
Description: reversible mac-style transformation manager for Ubuntu GNOME
 MacUbuntu audits, plans, applies, updates and safely removes a deep mac-style
 Ubuntu GNOME configuration using one shared CLI/JSON transaction engine.
 The package includes the GTK4/libadwaita graphical application and desktop
 integration while preserving ownership tracking and drift-safe uninstall.
